{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Magic Inn</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine <i>Fae Farm's</i> magic combined with <i>Travellers Rest's</i> cozy simulation. Build and customize your dream tavern, managing menus, staff, and rooms. Use <i>Potionomics</i>-inspired card battles to connect with guests and build meaningful relationships on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The prologue is free and includes a part of the main character\u2019s story, which takes place in one of the three kingdoms, Kingdom Crop. Uncover the truth behind the tragedy that befell your family, reclaim the reputation of the wizarding community and rescue the princess in order to return to the Magic Castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344760/extras/4bb2e761bf68d18a17ba430ebb3354a2.poster.avif?t=1753239291\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344760/extras/4bb2e761bf68d18a17ba430ebb3354a2.webm?t=1753239291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344760/extras/4bb2e761bf68d18a17ba430ebb3354a2.mp4?t=1753239291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong>Key Features:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Embark on a journey about tragedy and redemption, all starting with a magical humble inn. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Manage the menus, staff, and rooms of your completely customizable inn. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Learn and harness magic spells in order to help with inn management. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Engage in conversation-driving card battles which simulate actions such as negotiation, persuasion, and attraction. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Build relationships with guests and members of the inn\u2019s staff. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Collect magical creatures and items as you journey through this enchanted universe.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3344760?t=1753239291","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3344760?t=1753239291","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344760/154cf64435e9c386c8ee554ddccb34e17a3476ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753239291","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344760/154cf64435e9c386c8ee554ddccb34e17a3476ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753239291","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Magic Inn</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine <i>Fae Farm's</i> magic combined with <i>Travellers Rest's</i> cozy simulation. Build and customize your dream tavern, managing menus, staff, and rooms. Use <i>Potionomics</i>-inspired card battles to connect with guests and build meaningful relationships on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The prologue is free and includes a part of the main character\u2019s story, which takes place in one of the three kingdoms, Kingdom Crop. Uncover the truth behind the tragedy that befell your family, reclaim the reputation of the wizarding community and rescue the princess in order to return to the Magic Castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344760/extras/4bb2e761bf68d18a17ba430ebb3354a2.poster.avif?t=1753239291\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.stea